 Sound control (pilot): settings, enable flow, status notification 

 :root { color-scheme: light dark; --bg:#14161a; --card:#1d2026; --line:#2c313a; --fg:#e8eaee; --mute:#9aa1ad; --accent:#8fb4ff; --ok:#8fd08f; --warn:#e6b35a; --chip:#262b33; --on:#33477a; }
 @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) { :root { --bg:#f6f7f9; --card:#fff; --line:#dde0e6; --fg:#1b1e24; --mute:#5b6370; --accent:#2f5bd2; --ok:#2e7d32; --warn:#9a6a00; --chip:#eceff4; --on:#cfdcff; }
 }
 body { margin:0; font:14px/1.4 var(--font-sans, system-ui, sans-serif); }
 h2 { font-size:15px; margin:14px 0 4px; }
 p.note { margin:0 0 8px; color:var(--mute); font-size:13px; }
 .row { display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:flex-start; }
 .phone { width:290px; background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:22px; padding:10px 12px 14px; }
 .bar { display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; font-size:17px; padding:4px 2px 10px; }
 .grp { color:var(--accent); font-weight:600; font-size:12px; margin:10px 2px 4px; }
 .card { background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; padding:10px 12px; margin:6px 0; }
 .card b { display:block; font-weight:600; }
 .card span, .small { color:var(--mute); font-size:12.5px; }
 .sw { float:right; width:34px; height:18px; border-radius:10px; background:var(--accent); position:relative; }
 .sw::after { content:""; position:absolute; right:2px; top:2px; width:14px; height:14px; border-radius:7px; background:var(--bg); }
 .sw.off { background:var(--chip); } .sw.off::after { right:auto; left:2px; background:var(--mute); }
 .chk { display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:flex-start; margin:6px 0; }
 .dot { width:18px; height:18px; border-radius:9px; flex:none; display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:11px; }
 .dot.ok { background:var(--ok); color:#000; } .dot.todo { border:1.5px solid var(--warn); color:var(--warn); }
 .btn { display:inline-block; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:16px; background:var(--on); border:1px solid var(--accent); font-size:12.5px; margin-top:6px; }
 .pill { padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; background:var(--chip); font-size:12px; margin-right:4px; }
 .notif { background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:16px; padding:10px 12px; margin:8px 0; }
 .notif .t { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--mute); }
 .notif .h { font-weight:600; margin-top:2px; }
 .notif .a { color:var(--accent); font-size:12.5px; margin-top:6px; }
 .legend { max-width:330px; font-size:13px; } .legend li { margin:4px 0; }



 Sound control (pilot) 
 Three views: the settings section (under Settings &rarr; Features &rarr; Notifications), the first-time enable flow, and what the phone shows once it is on. Same card and row styles as the approved S
ettings screens. 



 &larr; Sound control 
 Mute other apps Pilot. Farhan keeps its own Do Not Disturb rule on. 
 Breakthrough 
 Which notifications make sound Elected by app and category. Today: 4 apps, 2 categories 
 Sound Match each app's own sound &bull; falls back to: Farhan default 
 Calls 
 Calls follow your Do Not Disturb call settings Farhan copies who may call you through, and repeat callers. You tested this? Tell us in About. 
 Status 
 Farhan's rule: On Effective mode: Priority only &bull; Your own DND: off Open Android Modes Turn off 
 Experiments 
 Open a short window instead Lets everything through for a few seconds when something should sound. Other apps will also sound in that window. 

 1. Settings section. 



 &larr; Turn on sound control 
 Farhan needs three things from Android. You can undo each in Android Settings. 
 &#10003; Notification access Already on 
 2 Do Not Disturb access Lets Farhan add and remove its own rule. It cannot read or change your other rules. Open Android settings 
 3 Post notifications So elected alerts and the status notification can appear. Allow 
 Before you turn it on 
 &bull; If Farhan stops while the rule is on, your phone can stay muted until Farhan reconnects or you turn the rule off in Android Settings. &bull; Elected alerts come from Farhan, with Farhan's chan
nel, not the original app. &bull; A stricter Do Not Disturb mode of your own still silences them. &bull; Calls follow your own call settings; check them after enabling. 
 I understand, turn it on 

 2. First-time enable flow. 



 Notification shade 
 Farhan &bull; managing Do Not Disturb now Farhan is managing Do Not Disturb Priority only. Other apps are silent. OFF &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; MODES 
 Farhan &bull; Messenger &bull; sound 11:00 Alex Running late, see you at 11:30 REPLY &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; OPEN 
 Reddit 11:00 &bull; silent New reply in r/android Kept quiet by Farhan 

 3. Shade: the status line (low importance, with Off), one elected alert that sounded, and a muted notification.
